  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    top_color = grid[0][1]\n    bottom_color = grid[rows-1][1]\n    left_color = grid[1][0]\n    right_color = grid[1][cols-1]\n    \n    border_map = {top_color: 'top', bottom_color: 'bottom', left_color: 'left', right_color: 'right'}\n    \n    # Collect interior colored points\n    points = []\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        for c in range(1, cols-1):\n            if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                points.append((r, c, grid[r][c]))\n    \n    # Create clean output\n    out = [[0]*cols for _ in range(rows)]\n    # Copy borders\n    for c in range(cols): out[0][c] = grid[0][c]; out[rows-1][c] = grid[rows-1][c]\n    for r in range(rows): out[r][0] = grid[r][0]; out[r][cols-1] = grid[r][cols-1]\n    \n    for r, c, color in points:\n        if color not in border_map:\n            continue\n        side = border_map[color]\n        if side == 'top':\n            out[1][c] = color\n        elif side == 'bottom':\n            out[rows-2][c] = color\n        elif side == 'left':\n            out[r][1] = color\n        elif side == 'right':\n            out[r][cols-2] = color\n    \n    return out\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    top_color = grid[0][1]\n    bottom_color = grid[rows-1][1]\n    left_color = grid[1][0]\n    right_color = grid[1][cols-1]\n    \n    border_map = {top_color: 'top', bottom_color: 'bottom', left_color: 'left', right_color: 'right'}\n    \n    # Collect interior colored points\n    points = []\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        for c in range(1, cols-1):\n            if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                points.append((r, c, grid[r][c]))\n    \n    # Create clean output\n    out = [[0]*cols for _ in range(rows)]\n    # Copy borders\n    for c in range(cols): out[0][c] = grid[0][c]; out[rows-1][c] = grid[rows-1][c]\n    for r in range(rows): out[r][0] = grid[r][0]; out[r][cols-1] = grid[r][cols-1]\n    \n    for r, c, color in points:\n        if color not in border_map:\n            continue\n        side = border_map[color]\n        if side == 'top':\n            out[1][c] = color\n        elif side == 'bottom':\n            out[rows-2][c] = color\n        elif side == 'left':\n            out[r][1] = color\n        elif side == 'right':\n            out[r][cols-2] = color\n    \n    return out",
